Activate to Seal Fate for 5 turns.  When you damage a target while Seal Fate is active you gain Spin and have a [4%, 19%, 27%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] chance to increase the duration of one detrimental status effect on it by one turn.

If you have Spin Fate active the chance will be increased by 33% per Spin (for [8%, 38%, 55%, 65%, 72% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] at three Spin.)

The duration increase can occur up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] times per turn and the bonus Spin once per turn.
